WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,180 --> 00:00:01,660
You have been through life and death for so many years

2
00:00:01,660 --> 00:00:02,980
I just saved so many military points.

3
00:00:02,980 --> 00:00:04,060
Enter it all now

4
00:00:04,060 --> 00:00:05,220
Why are friends so important?

5
00:00:05,220 --> 00:00:07,140
I heard that you moved out some time ago

6
00:00:07,140 --> 00:00:10,130
It's just for him, okay?

7
00:00:10,490 --> 00:00:12,610
The rare metals recovered by the trading center yesterday

8
00:00:12,610 --> 00:00:14,610
It really solved the coal-burning problem of the military industrial hall.

9
00:00:15,010 --> 00:00:16,010
For this reason

10
00:00:16,010 --> 00:00:17,010
I'll make an exception for him

11
00:00:17,570 --> 00:00:18,860
Received in three installments

12
00:00:18,860 --> 00:00:20,460
Don't let the rescue team come to trouble me

13
00:00:21,660 --> 00:00:23,260
Next time, bring the object to me for a look

14
00:00:24,020 --> 00:00:25,020
Where did the object come from?

15
00:00:25,220 --> 00:00:26,220
I haven’t even written my horoscope yet.

16
00:00:26,780 --> 00:00:31,400
There are so many submachine pistols, mini explosive rounds, M7 tear gas canisters.

17
00:00:31,400 --> 00:00:32,400
It was explained above

18
00:00:32,600 --> 00:00:35,400
The rest can only be exchanged for conventional weapons.

19
00:00:35,400 --> 00:00:37,800
I want a pistol, bullets, body armor and a helmet.

20
00:00:38,400 --> 00:00:46,760
four million points

21
00:00:46,760 --> 00:00:47,960
Just replaced four boxes.

22
00:00:47,960 --> 00:00:49,160
The most expensive weapons of all forces

23
00:00:49,160 --> 00:00:54,560
There are already quite a few of these. The agreed 20% is the same. You don’t need it. You can keep it for your own protection. I really don’t want it.
